-- CISSP Domain 3 expansion, part C of 3 (final): objective 3.7 cryptanalytic attacks (brute force, frequency analysis, known-plaintext, chosen-plaintext, man-in-the-middle, side-channel timing/power analysis, birthday attack, rainbow tables), 3.8 site and facility design principles (CPTED layered defense zones, natural surveillance/access control/territorial reinforcement - the basic CPTED definition and its three-principle list are intentionally NOT restated, see ci-f-029/ci-f-091/ci-q-087), and 3.9 facility security controls (fire detection/suppression systems, HVAC, power redundancy, physical access control mechanisms, environmental monitoring - fire suppression class basics are intentionally NOT restated, see ci-f-031/ci-q-021).


